      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "I wanted a reviewer I own — I can change how it reviews —\nthat doesn't block merges, doesn't review every push,\nand will learn from whether the code got better,\nnot from whether the comment looked smart.\n\nSo i'm building one — ✨ eevee ✨",
      "originalText": "I wanted a reviewer I own — I can change how it reviews —\nthat doesn't block merges, doesn't review every push,\nand will learn from whether the code got better,\nnot from whether the comment looked smart.\n\nSo i'm building one — ✨ eevee ✨",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
