      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "They are better at finding bugs.\n\nI wanted a different failure mode:\n\nThey optimize for comments and merge speed.\n\nGreptile can auto-approve a 5/5.\n\nCodeRabbit reviews every push.\n\nTheir \"learning\" is 👍 on the review.",
      "originalText": "They are better at finding bugs.\n\nI wanted a different failure mode:\n\nThey optimize for comments and merge speed.\n\nGreptile can auto-approve a 5/5.\n\nCodeRabbit reviews every push.\n\nTheir \"learning\" is 👍 on the review.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 384,
      "width": 344.4,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1910390391,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 663754349,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "I wanted a reviewer I own —\nmore like a teammate than a gate.\n\nStays quiet. Never blocks.\nStill points at what's actually wrong.\n\nLearns from whether the code got better\n— anonymously —\nnot from whether the comment looked smart.",
      "originalText": "I wanted a reviewer I own —\nmore like a teammate than a gate.\n\nStays quiet. Never blocks.\nStill points at what's actually wrong.\n\nLearns from whether the code got better\n— anonymously —\nnot from whether the comment looked smart.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
