      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "  Criterion        Weight    This PR\n  ─────────────────────────────────────\n  Security            3       4 → 12\n  Correctness         3       4 → 12\n  Data safety         3       4 → 12\n  Blast radius        2       5 → 10\n  Test coverage       2       4 →  8\n  Readability         1       5 →  5\n  ─────────────────────────────────────\n                     14            59",
      "originalText": "  Criterion        Weight    This PR\n  ─────────────────────────────────────\n  Security            3       4 → 12\n  Correctness         3       4 → 12\n  Data safety         3       4 → 12\n  Blast radius        2       5 → 10\n  Test coverage       2       4 →  8\n  Readability         1       5 →  5\n  ─────────────────────────────────────\n                     14            59",
