      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "parseReview strips findings when the\nsafety rating is ≥ 3 — even if the model\nsent some anyway.\n\nThe threshold is not a suggestion.\n\nThat's customization you can enforce,\nnot customization you can request.",
      "originalText": "parseReview strips findings when the\nsafety rating is ≥ 3 — even if the model\nsent some anyway.\n\nThe threshold is not a suggestion.\n\nThat's customization you can enforce,\nnot customization you can request.",
      "textAlign": "left",
