      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "That's why a 10-minute review is viable:\nI'm not re-reading the repo\nbecause Slack was slow.\n\nAnd why Slack got find-before-post,\nand GitHub didn't — yet.",
