      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "JSON + GitHub POST + ReviewRecord + Slack.\n\nThe dangerous step. Crash here does replay —\nincluding the GitHub POST (not idempotent).\n\nA throw (Slack failed, claim stolen) is\nturn.failed. Eve does not retry that.\nThe row is still there for the next pass.",
      "originalText": "JSON + GitHub POST + ReviewRecord + Slack.\n\nThe dangerous step. Crash here does replay —\nincluding the GitHub POST (not idempotent).\n\nA throw (Slack failed, claim stolen) is\nturn.failed. Eve does not retry that.\nThe row is still there for the next pass.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
