      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "eve's Slack channel.\nDMs, @eevee, subscribed threads,\n/new resets the session.\n\nI did not invent a Slack bot.\nI installed a channel.\n\nThat's the \"out of the box,\nno extra product.\"",
      "originalText": "eve's Slack channel.\nDMs, @eevee, subscribed threads,\n/new resets the session.\n\nI did not invent a Slack bot.\nI installed a channel.\n\nThat's the \"out of the box,\nno extra product.\"",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e087",
