      "text": "Slack and Postgres cannot commit together, so:\n\n  1. Claim the row — pending → delivering,\n     5-minute lease on claimedAt.\n  2. First try: post, stamp review_record_id\n     into Slack metadata.\n  3. Retry (lease expired): look up that id\n     before posting.\n  4. markDelivered only if claimedAt is still ours.\n     Else throw — the other worker finishes.",
      "originalText": "Slack and Postgres cannot commit together, so:\n\n  1. Claim the row — pending → delivering,\n     5-minute lease on claimedAt.\n  2. First try: post, stamp review_record_id\n     into Slack metadata.\n  3. Retry (lease expired): look up that id\n     before posting.\n  4. markDelivered only if claimedAt is still ours.\n     Else throw — the other worker finishes.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
